  "_basis_note_sv": "Hela serien jan-okt 2026 pa samma grund: energi prissatt pa kvartens genomsnittspris (Intraday Continuous Average), tak for 1h, 2h och 4h, och cykelbudget 2,0 per dygn. Budgeten hojdes fran 1,3 eftersom det inte finns nagot fysiskt tak pa antalet cykler - 1,3 var ett antagande, inte en begransning. Taket vaxer kraftigt med budgeten: SE3 2h september 2026 ger 22 368 EUR vid 1,3 cykler, 27 734 vid 2,0, 33 564 vid 3,0 och 43 792 vid 6,0. Capture-andelen ska darfor alltid lasas tillsammans med vilken budget taket raknats pa.",
  "_basis_note_en": "The whole Jan-Oct 2026 series on one basis: energy priced on the quarter average price (Intraday Continuous Average), ceilings for 1h, 2h and 4h, and a cycle budget of 2.0 per day. Raised from 1.3 because there is no physical cap on cycles - 1.3 was an assumption, not a constraint. The ceiling grows sharply with the budget: SE3 2h September 2026 gives EUR 22,368 at 1.3 cycles, 27,734 at 2.0, 33,564 at 3.0 and 43,792 at 6.0. The capture share must therefore always be read together with the budget it was computed on."
